ace":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m013-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m013-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0277","start":277,"end":279,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0295","start":295,"end":297,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji047-021","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","surfaces":["季桓子","桓子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","quote":"孔子年四十二，魯昭公卒於乾侯，定公立。定公立五年，夏，季平子卒，桓子嗣立。季桓子穿井得土缶，中若羊，問仲尼云「得狗」。仲尼曰：「以丘所聞，羊也。丘聞之，木石之怪夔、罔閬，水之怪龍、罔象，土之怪墳羊。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p013","quote":"桓子嬖臣曰仲梁懷，與陽虎有隙。陽虎欲逐懷，公山不狃止之。其秋，懷益驕，陽虎執懷。桓子怒，陽虎因囚桓子，與盟而醳之。陽虎由此益輕季氏。季氏亦僭於公室，陪臣執國政，是以魯自大夫以下皆僭離於正道。故孔子不仕，退而脩詩書禮樂，弟子彌衆，至自遠方，莫不受業焉。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p014","quote":"定公八年，公山不狃不得意於季氏，因陽虎為亂，欲廢三桓之適，更立其庶孽陽虎素所善者，遂執季桓子。桓子詐之，得脫。定公九年，陽虎不勝，奔于齊。是時孔子年五十。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","quote":"齊人聞而懼，曰：「孔子為政必霸，霸則吾地近焉，我之為先并矣。盍致地焉？」黎鉏曰：「請先嘗沮之；沮之而不可則致地，庸遲乎！」於是選齊國中女子好者八十人，皆衣文衣而舞康樂，文馬三十駟，遺魯君。陳女樂文馬於魯城南高門外，季桓子微服往觀再三，將受，乃語魯君為周道游，往觀終日，怠於政事。子路曰：「夫子可以行矣。」孔子曰：「魯今且郊，如致膰乎大夫，則吾猶可以止。」桓子卒受齊女樂，三日不聽政；郊，又不致膰俎於大夫。孔子遂行，宿乎屯。而師己送，曰：「夫子則非罪。」孔子曰：「吾歌可夫？」歌曰：「彼婦之口，可以出走；彼婦之謁，可以死敗。蓋優哉游哉，維以卒歲！」師己反，桓子曰：「孔子亦何言？」師己以實告。桓子喟然嘆曰：「夫子罪我以羣婢故也夫！」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p039","quote":"秋，季桓子病，輦而見魯城，喟然嘆曰：「昔此國幾興矣，以吾獲罪於孔子，故不興也。」顧謂其嗣康子曰：「我即死，若必相魯；相魯，必召仲尼。」後數日，桓子卒，康子代立。已葬，欲召仲尼。公之魚曰：「昔吾先君用之不終，終為諸侯笑。今又用之，不能終，是再為諸侯笑。」康子曰：「則誰召而可？」曰：「必召冉求。」於是使使召冉求。冉求將行，孔子曰：「魯人召求，非小用之，將大用之也。」是日，孔子曰：「歸乎歸乎！吾黨之小子狂簡，斐然成章，吾不知所以裁之。」子貢知孔子思歸，送冉求，因誡曰「即用，以孔子為招」云。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名、字、對話自稱、世系及附贊局部對應；世系求與冉求分開，武不接漢武帝，今皇帝與高皇帝不補姓名。子路仲由明示同指另存，冉有冉求與秦繆秦穆仍待核；附贊不當獨立作者正文或獨立見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","text":"孔子年四十二，魯昭公卒於乾侯，定公立。定公立五年，夏，季平子卒，桓子嗣立。季桓子穿井得土缶，中若羊，問仲尼云「得狗」。仲尼曰：「以丘所聞，羊也。丘聞之，木石之怪夔、罔閬，水之怪龍、罔象，土之怪墳羊。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"魯昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"x06_36x_8rd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"季平子","kind":"person","person_id":"bye_bxt_gks","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"丘","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"丘","k