、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p014","text":"定公八年，公山不狃不得意於季氏，因陽虎為亂，欲廢三桓之適，更立其庶孽陽虎素所善者，遂執季桓子。桓子詐之，得脫。定公九年，陽虎不勝，奔于齊。是時孔子年五十。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"公山不狃","kind":"person","person_id":"ia8_8tw_gey","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0024","start":24,"end":28,"surface":"三桓之適","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"庶孽","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p020","text":"齊人聞而懼，曰：「孔子為政必霸，霸則吾地近焉，我之為先并矣。盍致地焉？」黎鉏曰：「請先嘗沮之；沮之而不可則致地，庸遲乎！」於是選齊國中女子好者八十人，皆衣文衣而舞康樂，文馬三十駟，遺魯君。陳女樂文馬於魯城南高門外，季桓子微服往觀再三，將受，乃語魯君為周道游，往觀終日，怠於政事。子路曰：「夫子可以行矣。」孔子曰：「魯今且郊，如致膰乎大夫，則吾猶可以止。」桓子卒受齊女樂，三日不聽政；郊，又不致膰俎於大夫。孔子遂行，宿乎屯。而師己送，曰：「夫子則非罪。」孔子曰：「吾歌可夫？」歌曰：「彼婦之口，可以出走；彼婦之謁，可以死敗。蓋優哉游哉，維以卒歲！」師己反，桓子曰：「孔子亦何言？」師己以實告。桓子喟然嘆曰：「夫子罪我以羣婢故也夫！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"黎鉏","kind":"person","person_id":"ind_hfs_rpw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0067","start":67,"end":74,"surface":"女子好者八十人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"魯君","kind":"person","person_id":"xhk_2v1_pd8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"女樂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"魯君","kind":"person","person_id":"xhk_2v1_pd8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"子路","kind":"person","person_id":"1nt_8g8_bif","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-014