i-047-kong:m020-0303","start":303,"end":305,"surface":"夫子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m020-0308","start":308,"end":310,"surface":"羣婢","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p039","text":"秋，季桓子病，輦而見魯城，喟然嘆曰：「昔此國幾興矣，以吾獲罪於孔子，故不興也。」顧謂其嗣康子曰：「我即死，若必相魯；相魯，必召仲尼。」後數日，桓子卒，康子代立。已葬，欲召仲尼。公之魚曰：「昔吾先君用之不終，終為諸侯笑。今又用之，不能終，是再為諸侯笑。」康子曰：「則誰召而可？」曰：「必召冉求。」於是使使召冉求。冉求將行，孔子曰：「魯人召求，非小用之，將大用之也。」是日，孔子曰：「歸乎歸乎！吾黨之小子狂簡，斐然成章，吾不知所以裁之。」子貢知孔子思歸，送冉求，因誡曰「即用，以孔子為招」云。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"其嗣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神怪、對話、廟稱合稱或親屬指代待核，不補姓名、成員及闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"康子","kind":"person","person_id":"4ej_bfp_hod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"康子","kind":"person","person_id":"4ej_bfp_hod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m039-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":